 "notes": "PARTIAL. The official plate gallery (secure2.kentucky.gov/kytc/plates/web/) is a JS app that WebFetch was blocked from opening, so there are no agency image URLs (all source_img are null) and no retirements were checked. 'New' comes mainly from the KYTC 'New Special License Plates' flyer (undated, c. Jan 2024; the 2024 years are inferred), and only Kentuckians for the Arts is independently confirmed on sale. The flyer's 'Coming soon' group (EMS Memorial, Appalachian Valley Autism, Never Alone Nick fentanyl awareness, Shaker Village, KY Down Syndrome Association, Friends of Hemp) plus 'Cities Drive Kentucky' (KLC, due 2026) and a 2026 disaster-relief plate are left out as unconfirmed. Motorcycle versions are skipped."
